# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# System Parameter prototype - ignore rules
#
# Confidential material (registry credentials, private design references,
# PRDs, internal screenshots) must never reach GitHub. `npm run check:secrets`
# scans tracked or staged files for leaked credentials, and the
# .githooks/pre-commit hook runs that scan before every commit.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Credentials, tokens and machine-local configuration -------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.env
.npmrc
npmrc
*.npmrc
!.npmrc.example
.yarnrc
.yarnrc.yml
.netrc
_netrc
